#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-16j[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-16j/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate resolution and shared notification dispatch[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: extract the NotificationModal action routing into a shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dispatcher, then build the in-memory AgentEnterTarget resolver (pending [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate rows, identity-matched gate notifications, legacy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]question/HITL/remote-attention sources, and the node's Patch) and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]target executor, all without new UI-thread disk reads.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]AgentActionChooserModal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chooser[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chooser: add the self-contained single-keypress chooser modal: generic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]choice view model, deterministic g/1-9/p key assignment, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AgentView-family styling, unit tests, and one PNG visual golden.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Enter keymap swap and ,n retirement[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, chooser[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: add the act_on_agent app action bound to enter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](jump_to_agent_patch stays as an unbound action), connect the resolver [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the chooser, retire leader.jump_to_notification as a relocated key, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update the footer, help, palette, onboarding, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-16j","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-16j.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d2618a71470462ce05ab3e06ce84c765","started_at":"2026-09-22T17:40:56.634999+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-16j","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16j.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16j.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16j.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-16j.land"]}
